account_statement_common
========================

Shared bank statement management for Tryton, independent of the bank gateway.

Features
--------

* Statement origin numbering and accounting workflows.
* Reconciliation suggestions for invoices, payments, move lines and sales.
* Configurable suggestion weights and amount tolerances.
* Assistants for linking invoices and creating statement lines.
* Optional AEB43, analytic accounting and account bank integrations.
* Shared import methods for bank synchronization connectors.

See doc/index.rst for the connector contract and upgrade instructions.

